      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "7.1 Agricultural Overview"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Agriculture is the backbone of Rajasthan's economy, employing more than 62% of the workforce. However, it faces challenges like low and erratic rainfall, poor soil quality in desert areas, and water scarcity. The state is divided into agro-climatic zones.",
      "id": "t2m0iya"
    },
